  <main_text>
    <l n="1">ti erant non nulla, ob quæ Spanhemius</l>
    <l n="2">ejusque Fratres diffidebant ab aliis, quos</l>
    <l n="3">tamen Fratrum loco habuisse debuissent.</l>
    <l n="4">Libertatem spirabant hi, &amp; servitutem</l>
    <l n="5">ferre nescii læsuro papaturientium Fra-</l>
    <l n="6">trum jugo colla subtrahebant. hoc crimen</l>
    <l n="7">est, hinc illæ lachrymæ. Spirabant autem</l>
    <l n="8">illi tyrannidem, atque huic dominationis</l>
    <l n="9">spei quum esset litandum, ea ex Magnorum</l>
    <l n="10">Virorum scriptis collegerunt &amp; corrasè-</l>
    <l n="11">runt, quæ detorta &amp; mutilata gravissimæ</l>
    <l n="12">accusationis argumentum &amp; diræ admo-</l>
    <l n="13">dum delationis materiam essent suppedita-</l>
    <l n="14">tura. Experturi an Procerum Plebisque</l>
    <l n="15">animos ad odium accusatorum Fratrum</l>
    <l n="16">renovare &amp; revocare possent. Hinc de pe-</l>
    <l n="17">riculosis Novitatibus clamores, hinc de</l>
    <l n="18">Atheismo, Scepticismo, Socinianismo,</l>
    <l n="19">Nestorianismo, Pelagianismo, Chiliasmo</l>
    <l n="20">accusationes; quorum criminum singula,</l>
    <l n="21">sijus reddat prætor, deportationem reo-</l>
    <l n="22">rum, seu Professorum seu Ministrorum</l>
    <l n="23">Ecclesiæ, mereantur.</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">Hoc modo accusati Cartesii Cocceji-</l>
    <l n="25">que quondam Auditores, quique eorum</l>
    <l n="26">scripta</l>
  </main_text>
